# Loot filter drop directory.
#
# Place one or more *.filter files here to make them selectable from the
# launcher menu. Only regular files whose names match
#   [A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]{0,127}.filter
# are listed; everything else (directories, symlinks, other extensions,
# oversized files > 4 MiB) is ignored. The menu always shows DEFAULT first,
# which maps to the shipped no-filter default.filter.
#
# See docs/LOOT-FILTER.md for details. This file is not a filter and is
# never loaded by the game.
